THE winning entries in the EAW Budget Menu Competition came from different parts of the country and showed how varied and interesting everyday meals could be made for four persons at a maximum cost of 15p per person. These food prices were costed at October 31, 1972, during the period when the competition was being carried out at Branch level and then at Area level.

